        {
          "title": "亚马逊的球形温室",
          "content": "<p>亚马逊公司的西雅图总部园区内，有三个巨大的球形温室，高达三四层楼（24米到29米），作为员工休息室和办公区。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202111/bg2021110306.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202111/bg2021110307.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202111/bg2021110308.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>温室里面有各种热带植物，还设置了会议室和零售商店，每个球体可容纳800人，主要供员工使用，每周固定时间免费开放给公众参观。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202111/bg2021110312.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202111/bg2021110315.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202111/bg2021110317.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>球形温室于2015年正式动工。2018年1月29日落成，总共耗资40亿美元。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202111/bg2021110310.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202111/bg2021110316.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202111/bg2021110313.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202111/bg2021110314.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "亚马逊的球形温室",
              "url": "https://www.sohu.com/a/220142155_117195"
            }
          ],
